#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/applications/file-roller.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>File Roller</application> is an archive manager for "
"<application>GNOME</application> with support for tar, bzip2, bzip3, gzip, "
"zip, jar, compress, lzop, zstd, dmg, and many other archive formats."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/gnome/applications/file-roller.xml:39
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>File Roller</application> is only a graphical interface to "
"archiving utilities such as <application>tar</application> and "
"<application>zip</application>."
msgstr ""

